      "writtenOn": "2025-04-09T14:33:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is quite simple to keep this in some local CL and then run dev helper locally?\n\nIs there some reason it cannot be a personal CL and needs to be present in production code?",
      "parentUuid": "2a36c5dd_bd5650c9",
      "revId": "746f76c2ca4285d9c6ebac95612e96eab3e02d0b",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4e067cb1_bacb887b",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1013302
